# Git workflow (Cursor) — FOUNDER MODE ENFORCEMENT

## 🎯 FOUNDER MODE GATE (2026-06-02+)

**Before creating any branch, ask:**
1. Does this help Peskids go live? (YES = proceed; NO = next Q)
2. Does this make Blueprint replicable? (YES = proceed; NO = next Q)
3. Does this measure lead conversion? (YES = proceed; NO = DON'T BRANCH)

**If NO to all three → do NOT push. Escalate to Founder.**

### Branch Naming Enforcement
- **Peskids work:** `peskids/*` (e.g., `peskids/go-live-fixes`, `peskids/auth-flow`)
- **Blueprint work:** `blueprint/*` (e.g., `blueprint/extract-template`, `blueprint/docs`)
- **Agency work:** `agency/*` (e.g., `agency/replication-guide`)
- **Docs/rules updates:** `docs/*` (e.g., `docs/founder-mode-goal`)
- **Bug fixes:** `fix/{peskids|blueprint|agency}/*` (tag the goal)
- **Refactor:** Only if tagged to goal; `refactor/{peskids|blueprint}/*`

**No arbitrary feature branches.** Every branch must map to Founder Mode goal.

### Commit Message Format (ENFORCED)
```
{type}({scope}): {description}

{body}

Contributes to: peskids|blueprint|agency
```

**Scopes that map to goal:**
- `peskids` — go-live, production fixes
- `blueprint` — reusable template, extraction
- `agency` — replication, distribution
- `docs` — FOUNDER MODE rules, AGENTS.md updates

**Example:**
```
feat(peskids): add whatsapp notifications for go-live

Enable SMS/WhatsApp alerts so live customers get instant notifications.

Contributes to: peskids
```

**Rejected (don't commit):**
```
refactor(orchestrator): cleanup unused types  # ← Not tied to goal
feat(platform): add new MCP tool               # ← Platform bloat
docs(unrelated): update README                 # ← Not tagged
```

